msgid "Help us make Quarkus even better, anonymously."
msgstr "请匿名帮助我们让 Quarkus 变得更好。"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:1
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Quarkus Usage Analytics"
msgstr "Quarkus 使用分析"

#. type: Title ##
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:7
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Why does Quarkus want to gather usage analytics?"
msgstr "Quarkus 为什么要收集使用情况分析数据？"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:10
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Usage analytics (telemetry collection) is invaluable for the Quarkus team and contributors to gauge which operating systems, java version, build systems, extensions and more are used. This service is provided by Red Hat and the details can be found on [usage policy](/usage/policy) page.\n"
msgstr "使用情况分析（遥测数据收集）对于 Quarkus 团队和贡献者而言极为重要，有助于他们了解用户使用的操作系统、Java 版本、构建系统、扩展等。该服务由 Red Hat 提供，详细信息请参阅 [使用政策](/usage/policy) 页面。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:11
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "How will this work?"
msgstr "这将如何运作？"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:14
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "In order to get this information, beginning in Quarkus 3.2, when you run Quarkus the first time in dev mode (`quarkus dev`, `mvn quarkus:dev`, etc.) you get asked if you agree to contribute anonymous build data to the Quarkus community.\n"
msgstr "为了获取这些信息，从 Quarkus 3.2 开始，当您首次以开发模式运行 Quarkus 时（例如 `quarkus dev`、`mvn quarkus:dev` 等），系统会询问您是否同意向 Quarkus 社区提交匿名构建数据。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:16
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "![/assets/images/usage-prompt-arrows.png](/assets/images/usage-prompt-arrows.webp)\n"
msgstr "![/assets/images/usage-prompt-arrows.png](/assets/images/usage-prompt-arrows.webp)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:18
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "By answering **\"Yes\"**, when you perform a quarkus build, anonymized data is sent to gather usage statistics on how Quarkus is being used and adopted.\n"
msgstr "如果您选择**“是”**，则在执行 quarkus build 操作时，系统会发送匿名数据，用于收集有关 Quarkus 使用和采用情况的统计信息。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:20
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "However if you answer **\"No\"**, then no usage data is sent and you will not be asked again.\n"
msgstr "但是，如果您回答**“否”**，则不会发送任何使用数据，且系统也不会再次询问您。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:22
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "We will share what is learned from these anonymous usage data and plan on integrate things like usage and adoption into sites like [extensions.quarkus.io](https://extensions.quarkus.io) and [code.quarkus.io](https://code.quarkus.io).\n"
msgstr "我们将分享从这些匿名使用数据中获得的见解，并计划将使用情况和采用率等指标整合到 [extensions.quarkus.io](https://extensions.quarkus.io) 和 [code.quarkus.io](https://code.quarkus.io) 等网站中。\n"

#. type: Title ##
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:23
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "How can I enable and disable ?"
msgstr "如何启用和禁用该功能？"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:26
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Build time analytics is not active by default. If you have opted in and would like to disable build time analytics or would like to later enable collection, you can do so in two ways:\n"
msgstr "构建时间分析功能默认处于关闭状态。如果您已选择启用该功能，但希望将其关闭，或者希望稍后启用数据收集，可以通过以下两种方式操作：\n"

#. type: Title ###
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:27
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Set globally"
msgstr "全局设置"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:30
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "You can manually configure the global settings by editing the `io.quarkus.analytics.localconfig` file in the `.redhat` folder of your user’s home directory.\n"
msgstr "您可以通过编辑用户主目录下 `.redhat` 文件夹中的 `io.quarkus.analytics.localconfig` 文件，手动配置全局设置。\n"

#. type: Title ####
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:31
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "To enable analytics collection"
msgstr "启用分析数据收集"

#. type: Fenced code block
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:33
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "{\"disabled\":false}\n"
msgstr "{\"disabled\":false}\n"

#. type: Title ####
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:37
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "To disable analytics collection"
msgstr "要禁用分析数据收集"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: content/usage.md:39
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "{\"disabled\":true}\n"
msgstr "{\"禁用\":true}。"

#. type: Title ###
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:43
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "Set per build"
msgstr "按构建设置"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:46
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "You can configure it for a given build by using the `quarkus.analytics.disabled` system property:\n"
msgstr "您可以通过使用 `quarkus.analytics.disabled` 系统属性，针对特定构建进行配置：\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:49
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "To disable analytics collection, set `quarkus.analytics.disabled` to `true`.\n"
msgstr "要禁用分析数据收集，请将 `quarkus.analytics.disabled` 设置为 `true`。\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:49
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "To enable analytics collection, set `quarkus.analytics.disabled` to `false`.\n"
msgstr "要启用分析数据收集，请将 `quarkus.analytics.disabled` 设置为 `false`。\n"

#. type: Plain text
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:51
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "For instance, when using Maven, you can disable analytics collection for a single run with:\n"
msgstr "例如，在使用 Maven 时，可以通过以下方式禁用单次运行的分析数据收集：\n"

#. type: Fenced code block
#. mt: deepl
#: content/usage.md:52
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
msgid "./mvnw clean install -Dquarkus.analytics.disabled=true\n"
msgstr "./mvnw clean install -Dquarkus.analytics.disabled=true\n"
